<title>Cool Roof ROI: prompt rewritten and built</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600&display=swap">
<style>:root{color-scheme:light only;supported-color-schemes:light}</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F1F3F4">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#F1F3F4" style="background-color:#F1F3F4">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 16px">
<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="640" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="width:100%;max-width:640px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E3E6E8;border-radius:16px">
<tr><td style="padding:32px 32px 32px 24px">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23">Hello Nasir,</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 0 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="border-left:3px solid #2E4A66;padding:0 0 0 16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">The Cool Roof ROI prompt is rewritten and cleaned up; the new version is attached. I also built it in Lovable so you can see the result: /cool-roof-roi, a new page on the VEXTRON Apex Systems project, with its own header and footer.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">Next decisions</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Let me know if these changes are OK.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#F4F1FD" style="background-color:#F4F1FD;border:1.5px solid #5B45C2;border-radius:16px;padding:16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="top" width="24" style="width:24px;padding:0 16px 0 0"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="24" height="24" align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#5B45C2" style="width:24px;height:24px;background-color:#5B45C2;border-radius:8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:24px;color:#FFFFFF;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">?</td></tr></table></td><td valign="top"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;color:#1B1F23">Should I proceed with further fine-tuning of the page, or publish it as it is right now?</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Preview (Lovable sign-in): <a href="https://id-preview--744ab6e8-ec42-442c-92ab-93e23b287fd3.lovable.app/cool-roof-roi" style="color:#2E4A66;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#AFC0D1;font-weight:500;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:normal">https://id-preview--744ab6e8-ec42-442c-92ab-93e23b287fd3.lovable.app/cool-roof-roi</a></p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 24px 0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dmqyhwiwu/image/upload/c_scale,w_1152,q_auto/v1791436166/cool-roof-roi_desktop.png" width="576" alt="Cool Roof ROI page, desktop" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:576px;height:auto;border:1px solid #E3E6E8;border-radius:8px"><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Cool Roof ROI page, desktop</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#EAF4EE" style="background-color:#EAF4EE;border-left:3px solid #2F6B4F;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="top" width="24" style="width:24px;padding:0 16px 0 0"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="24" height="24" align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#2F6B4F" style="width:24px;height:24px;background-color:#2F6B4F;border-radius:8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:24px;color:#FFFFFF;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">✓</td></tr></table></td><td valign="top"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;color:#1B1F23">Your wording, stats and form are unchanged, and no dollar savings figure appears anywhere. Step 1 of the form saves as soon as someone clicks Continue, their answers stay if they go back, and step 2 completes the same lead with the UTM tags and time. Test entries were deleted.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">Brief vs. built</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#EAF4EE" style="background-color:#EAF4EE;border-left:3px solid #2F6B4F;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#2F6B4F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Prompt · Rewritten</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Rewrite it in a more engaging way and clean it up.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Built: A plain-language version with the same sections, copy, stats and form rules. Attached.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Why: Lovable follows plain, direct instructions more reliably than spec lists.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#EAF4EE" style="background-color:#EAF4EE;border-left:3px solid #2F6B4F;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#2F6B4F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Motion · Added</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">No video, no carousels, no animation libraries.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Built: Sections fade in as you scroll, the stats count up once, and cards lift on hover. Built with CSS and a small script only, and switched off for visitors who turn motion off.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Why: Makes the page more engaging while keeping your no-library rule.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#EDF1F5" style="background-color:#EDF1F5;border-left:3px solid #2E4A66;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#2E4A66;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Placement · Info</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">A single page: no other pages, no nav links.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Built: /cool-roof-roi, a new page on the existing VEXTRON project, with its own header and footer and no site menu.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Why: It lives on vextrons.com and uses the site&#x27;s existing lead database.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FBF4E2" style="background-color:#FBF4E2;border-left:3px solid #8A6414;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#8A6414;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Logo · Changed</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">The attached VEXTRON shield PNG.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Built: The shield logo already in the project.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Why: It was already in the project, so nothing had to be attached.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FBF4E2" style="background-color:#FBF4E2;border-left:3px solid #8A6414;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#8A6414;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Photos · Stand-ins</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Aerial of a coated white warehouse roof: &quot;I will upload&quot;.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Built: AI-made stand-in photos for the hero and both proof cards.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Why: Placeholders until your photos are in.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FBF4E2" style="background-color:#FBF4E2;border-left:3px solid #8A6414;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#8A6414;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Thank-you message · Added</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Show a thank-you state (no wording given).</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Built: A short thank-you message written by Lovable.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Why: The page needed copy to show after step 2.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">What&#x27;s left</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#F8E9E5" style="background-color:#F8E9E5;border-left:3px solid #9A4A3A;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="top" width="24" style="width:24px;padding:0 16px 0 0"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="24" height="24" align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#9A4A3A" style="width:24px;height:24px;background-color:#9A4A3A;border-radius:8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:24px;color:#FFFFFF;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">!</td></tr></table></td><td valign="top"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;color:#1B1F23">The thermal stand-in photo has invented temperatures printed on it (145°F / 78°F). It needs to be replaced before the page goes live.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#F8E9E5" style="background-color:#F8E9E5;border-left:3px solid #9A4A3A;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#9A4A3A;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir · Photos</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Real photos: the aerial of the coated warehouse roof, plus the two proof-card images.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#F8E9E5" style="background-color:#F8E9E5;border-left:3px solid #9A4A3A;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#9A4A3A;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir · Content</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Approve the thank-you message, or send your own wording.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#F8E9E5" style="background-color:#F8E9E5;border-left:3px solid #9A4A3A;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#9A4A3A;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir · Analytics</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Google Analytics ID (G-XXXXXXX), the same one as the contractor page. The generate_lead event fires on step 2 once it&#x27;s connected.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#F8E9E5" style="background-color:#F8E9E5;border-left:3px solid #9A4A3A;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#9A4A3A;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Shad · Speed</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Run the mobile Lighthouse test against the 90+ target. Not run yet.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#F8E9E5" style="background-color:#F8E9E5;border-left:3px solid #9A4A3A;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#9A4A3A;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Shad · Launch</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Publish to vextrons.com after your approval.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 0 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding-top:16px"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#4F575E"></p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">Shad</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
